abstract: >-
  CELLULAR ENGINE OMEGA v5.4.0 is a zero-dependency C11 multi-scale cellular biophysics
  simulation engine (16 quantitative testbeds, 75 computational substrates, 1,000-cell
  Hybrid Cube, 60 falsification gates, 16/16 planted mutants, 256-case fuzz/property harness)
  paired with 100 strictly constructive zero-Mathlib Pure Lean 4.35.0 discrete lemmas
  about the engine's software model (including 16 closed literal checks and C11-generated
  receipt literal equality checks O63/O72; zero Classical.choice), audited by the Lean
  4.35.0 reference kernel plus four independent checkers (lean4lean, nanoda_bin, con-leche,
  con-ron) under isolated Challenge/Solution comparator verification. Not peer-reviewed;
  retires 0 / 1,900 overarching open problems in unsolved-problems-mega-atlas.
